#. Tag: title
#: path-complete.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatic Text Completion"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: path-complete.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can get &konqueror; to help you enter a path or &URL; into the Location "
"Toolbar by enabling one of the <guimenuitem>Text Completion</guimenuitem> "
"features. To do this <mousebutton>right</mousebutton> click on a clear part "
"of the Location Toolbar text entry box and select <guisubmenu>Text "
"Completion</guisubmenu> from the pop up menu. This will let you choose "
"between the following options:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: path-complete.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "None"
msgstr "Pas cap"

#. Tag: para
#: path-complete.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "What you get is what you type."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: path-complete.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "Manual"

#. Tag: para
#: path-complete.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you have typed part of a path or &URL;, pressing <keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></keycombo> will complete the entry if it "
"is possible to do so unambiguously."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: path-complete.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Automatic"

#. Tag: para
#: path-complete.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As you type into the Location Toolbar window &konqueror; will automatically "
"extend what you type to complete one possible path or &URL;, highlighting "
"the characters it has added. Continue typing if that's not what you wanted "
"or press &Enter; to accept it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: path-complete.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dropdown List"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: path-complete.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A drop-down window will appear as you type, showing the possible matches to "
"what you have typed so far. When the path or &URL; that you want appears in "
"the window double click on it with the &LMB;. You can also use the "
"<keysym>Down Arrow</keysym> and <keysym>Up Arrow</keysym> keys to select it "
"then press &Enter;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: path-complete.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Short Automatic"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: path-complete.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is like Automatic mode except that it only extends what you have typed "
"as far as the next <keycap>/</keycap> symbol in the path or &URL;. Press "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></keycombo> to accept the "
"suggestion, &Enter; when the complete path or &URL; is shown."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: path-complete.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You should try out these different modes and pick the one that suits you "
"best."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: path-complete.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The history of recently visited &URL;s that &konqueror; uses for the Text "
"Completion function can be viewed and edited in the <guilabel>History </"
"guilabel> page of the <link linkend=\"sidebar\">Navigation Panel</link>."
msgstr ""
